# UX workflow: create sequencer pages/tracks and undo/redo structural history.
# Purpose: validates full-bank history entries for structure creation and the
# transient feedback toast for page/track structure changes.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen initial

# Create page 2 from the first add-slot preview.
150 encoder NAV 1
250 capture screen page_2_add_preview
350 tap NAV 60
550 capture screen page_2_created

# Undo page creation. Toast should identify Page Structure.
650 button LEFT_CENTER down
1650 tick
1700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
1850 capture screen undo_page_toast
1950 button LEFT_CENTER up
3300 capture screen page_creation_undone

# Redo page creation.
3400 button LEFT_CENTER down
4400 tick
4450 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
4600 capture screen redo_page_toast
4700 button LEFT_CENTER up
6050 capture screen page_creation_redone

# Switch to track navigation, create track 2, then undo it.
6150 tap NAV 60
6350 encoder NAV 1
6550 capture screen track_2_add_preview
6650 tap NAV 60
6850 capture screen track_2_created

6950 button LEFT_CENTER down
7950 tick
8000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8150 capture screen undo_track_toast
8250 button LEFT_CENTER up
9600 capture screen track_creation_undone
